OL,3,GNEWSAShetland prepares for final
OL,4,Aappointment with The Wicker Man
OL,5,
OL,6,FRobin Hardy always envisaged his iconic
OL,7,F1973 folk horror film The Wicker Man as
OL,8,Fthe first part of a trilogy.
OL,10,FThe Wicker Tree, released in 2011,
OL,11,Fbrought him closer to that ambition,
OL,12,Fbut his death in 2016 at the age of 86
OL,13,Fleft the project incomplete.
OL,15,FNow his sons, Justin and Dominic, have
OL,16,Fbeen able to complete their father's
OL,17,Ftrilogy, after finding a script for the
OL,18,Ffinal film.
OL,20,FAnd it's thanks to the surprise
OL,21,Fdiscovery of some long-lost family
OL,22,Farchive.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
